# UI copy stays in this desktop

Labels, hints, dialogs, toasts, and notifications (`I18n.t()` keys) describe
this environment only.

Do not mention the previous desktop, other backup products, other user
accounts, or migration/cutover in UI strings.

Docs and comments may still explain isolation. The shell the user reads
must not.
